			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"雷泽"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 80020301,
					"content": "这里，不欢迎，你。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80020302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雷泽"
				},
				{
					"id": 80020302,
					"content": "呵呵呵…仅剩残魂的狼，竟然还有养护子嗣的习性。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80020303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "深渊使徒"
				},
				{
					"id": 80020303,
					"content": "是想要作为护卫吗？但他的力量，显然不能与魔神曾经的利爪相比。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80020304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "深渊使徒"
				},
				{
					"id": 80020304,
					"content": "而只要服从于我们，你就能重获比肩神明的权柄，就像过去一样。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80020305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "深渊使徒"
				},
				{
					"id": 80020305,
					"content": "谗…言…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80020306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玻瑞亚斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 80020306,
					"content": "这是什么仪式？它看上去很痛苦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80020307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80020307,
					"content": "唔…是类似控制特瓦林心智时的「腐蚀」吗？！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80020308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80020308,
					"content": "狼，不屈服。但，不能，再继续。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80020309,
						80020310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雷泽"
				},
				{
					"id": 80020309,
					"content": "我来阻止它。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80020311
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80020311,
					"content": "不论几次，你们的努力都只是徒劳无功…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "深渊使徒"
				},
				{
					"id": 80020310,
					"content": "再战一次使徒而已。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80020311
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 800204,
			"completionStepIds": [
				800209
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"800209",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 800209,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"戴因斯雷布"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 80020401,
					"content": "巨大的神像，恢弘的教堂。蒙德人为了修建它们，必然花费了海量的资源与精力。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80020402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80020402,
					"content": "但收到这份礼物的风神，究竟感受到了多少，又回报了多少呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80020403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80020403,
					"content": "「信仰」是不求回报的吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80020404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80020404,
					"content": "哼，只要神灵心安理得，我也不多说什么。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80020405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80020405,
					"content": "嘘——！马上就要进教堂了，风神的坏话可不能乱说。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80020406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80020406,
					"content": "而且风神其实…呃，啊，没什么。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80020407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80020407,
					"content": "呵，我本来就没有进教堂的打算。与修女打交道的事，就交给你们了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80020408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80020408,
					"content": "欸？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80020409,
						80020410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80020409,
					"content": "之前都是一起行动的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80020411
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80020411,
					"content": "你是蒙德城的荣誉骑士，深受信任，他们应该会放心让你参与到这件事里。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80020412
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80020412,
					"content": "而我的出现，只会徒增警惕罢了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80020413,
						80020414
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80020413,
					"content": "因为是陌生人？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80020415
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80020415,
					"content": "嗯，而且就像小家伙说的一样，我随时…都可能说出教会不想听到的话。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80020416
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80020416,
					"content": "「拒信者」踏入「虔诚之地」，从来不会有什么好结果。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80020417
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80020417,
					"content": "我过去从未蒙受过神明的恩惠，现在和未来也没有必要。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80020418
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80020418,
					"content": "好了，这种事说得也够多了。我们在闲聊的时候，深渊教团可没有停下脚步。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80020419
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80020419,
					"content": "#唔，那，{NICKNAME}，就我们两个人去问问看吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80020420
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80020420,
					"content": "我还得提醒你们一句，你们最好也别向教会里的人提起「污秽逆位神像」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80020421
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80020421,
					"content": "西风教会对神像的事不会置之不理，但如果他们贸然插手，只怕会打草惊蛇。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80020422
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80020422,
					"content": "而且…不论是谁，触碰了与「深渊」有关的因果，一般也不会有太好的结局。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80020414,
					"content": "你觉得你会不受欢迎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80020415
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80020410,
					"content": "你不好奇吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80020411
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 800205,
			"completionStepIds": [
				800210
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"800210",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 800210,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
